			"43": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": false
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: OUTSIDE OF THE CENTER\n\nIn this example we have a small Circle node that moves from left to right because we send a Sinde into the Move node.\nThat same Sine value (between -1 and 1) is checked by the Outside node.\nIf the value is lower than -0.3 or greater than 0.3 we get true(1) as a result else we get a false(0).\nWe use this boolean in combination with a Smooth and Multiply to fade out the color when the output is false."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 598.6739501953125,
					"width": 1463.836669921875,
					"x": 108.9118499755859375,
					"y": -116.39452362060546875
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ffae7bff",
				"constants": {},
				"hidden": [
					"text",
					"alignment",
					"font-size",
					"fill"
				],
				"name": "Comment"
			},
			"45": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": false
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: CHECKING A BOUNDING BOX\n\nIn this example we have a collection of 10 circles moving in random directions.\nWe check the Float2 positions of the circles against the bounding box of the Rectangle geometry (using Bounding Box to convert the geometry to a Box2D type).\nWhen inside of outside of the box, we get a true(1), when inside the box we get a false(0).\nWe use Smooth to slowly transition between the 1 and 0 values, giving us this black hole kind of visual."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 598.6739501953125,
					"width": 1987.3934326171875,
					"x": 108.9929656982421875,
					"y": 505.495819091796875
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ff2dc18a",
